      "text_original": "Fifi has loved Teddy since she was a baby.",
      "text_zh": "从还是小宝宝的时候起，菲菲就喜欢泰迪熊了。",
      "image_alt": "穿红裙子的菲菲和棕色泰迪熊分别出现在白色画面上。",
      "image": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/page-001.jpg",
      "audio_zh": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/zh/0df0da74f419752e/page-001.mp3",
      "audio_original": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/en/3561a90fb9684671/page-001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "text_original": "Fifi eats with Teddy. Fifi plays with Teddy.",
      "text_zh": "菲菲和泰迪一起吃饭，也和泰迪一起玩。",
      "image_alt": "菲菲抱着泰迪熊坐在餐桌前，又带着它一起荡秋千。",
      "image": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/page-002.jpg",
      "audio_zh": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/zh/0df0da74f419752e/page-002.mp3",
      "audio_original": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/en/3561a90fb9684671/page-002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page_number": 3,
      "text_original": "Fifi takes Teddy wherever she goes. And they curl up together every night.",
      "text_zh": "不管去哪儿，菲菲都带着泰迪。每天晚上，他们还依偎着一起睡。",
      "image_alt": "菲菲坐车时抱着泰迪熊，晚上又在床上抱着它睡觉。",
      "image": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/page-003.jpg",
      "audio_zh": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/zh/0df0da74f419752e/page-003.mp3",
      "audio_original": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/en/3561a90fb9684671/page-003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page_number": 4,
      "text_original": "Fifi knows she cannot take Teddy to school. So every morning she leaves Teddy on her bed.",
      "text_zh": "菲菲知道，上学不能带泰迪。所以每天早上，她都把泰迪留在床上。",
      "image_alt": "泰迪熊独自坐在菲菲的床上，身后是画着红心的枕头。",
      "image": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/page-004.jpg",
      "audio_zh": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/zh/0df0da74f419752e/page-004.mp3",
      "audio_original": "/assets/books/bd-fifi-and-teddy/audio/en/3561a90fb9684671/page-004.mp3"
    },
    {
